MergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Git convention enforcement skill","messageBody":"Add a project-specific skill based on the SE-Education\nGit conventions. Update AGENTS.md to mandate following\nthe standard for all future commits and branches.\n\nReference: https://se-education.org/guides/conventions/git.html\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","tags":["A-CodingStandard"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":101,"deletions":1}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-02T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"4a8b515a21516b375e830d19ab534389ab1ce46e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"made todo class with inheritance","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":17,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"be53451cbcc4f39a4403e1ad76b18ca1064736c9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"implement todo in chatbot","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":7,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"67c6fa29da49fe2182f2e79083bce23921c88c3f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"add deadline class","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":16,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"96b013a9f5e940b2791034638bae06fb56ec3793","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"implement deadline in aglio","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":24,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"ff4291cf633fa3895d48a4dee94a47e1e0c4d7b4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"make event class","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":18,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"261ed4b746db2df62e32f39752873ad7cb7b64b0","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"implement event in aglio","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-4"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":9,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"2e44e79614e01308e18280bc139494a10da8d9f1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"add test-ui skill","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":276,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"4baa6142034b178af885c5fc1ca42615ab91274f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"add UI testing guidelines to AGENTS.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":12,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"87407821f72d030221c517bcdad4c2ad8d32554a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Replace magic number with named constant","messageBody":"The task array size 100 is a magic number whose meaning is not\nimmediately clear to the reader. Replacing it with a named\nconstant MAX_TASKS makes the intent explicit and provides a\nsingle place to update if the limit needs to change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":3,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"f9f45e3e1b890efd07c982e082ec47dc1d12b424","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Replace repeated divider string with named constant","messageBody":"The horizontal divider string is a magic literal repeated 8\ntimes throughout the file. If the divider style ever needs to\nchange, every occurrence must be found and updated. Extracting\nit into a DIVIDER constant eliminates this duplication and\nmakes the intent of each println call clearer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":7,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"01c4824cc5cfe0319b7b30d68c8a650d2cb3b0ad","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract duplicated task-added confirmation into method","messageBody":"The same three-line confirmation block (print task, increment\ncount, print count) was copy-pasted across the todo, deadline,\nand event branches. If the message format ever changes, all\nthree copies must be updated in sync — a common source of bugs.\nExtracting it into printTaskAdded() gives a single place to\nmaintain and makes each branch shorter and easier to read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":10,"deletions":9}}}]},{"date":"2